From f517e9ab596c06f813af854558f68c62f7be8501 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fengshuai <shuai.feng@sunmi.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:03:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 08/13] feat(workspace): add the Workspace edit slot and
 forced-new sessions

Declares sidebar.workspaces.workspace.edit (root-scoped, WorkspaceEditOwnerProps) so a Desktop contribution can put fields in the browser-owned edit dialog without taking over the row menu, and threads a fresh option through UiWorkspace.startSession/openWorkspace that creates a Session identity instead of adopting the Workspace's reusable blank one.
